    <header class="ui-masthead">
      <p class="ui-kicker">About this project</p>
      <h1>Help</h1>
      <p>What Informed Opinion is for, how to take part, and how individual answers produce a collective result weighted by factual knowledge.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="help-layout">
      <nav class="help-contents ui-panel" aria-label="On this page">
        <strong>On this page</strong>
